id: pm-gh1695
title: "GH-1695: accept settings paths and provide bounded config-key recovery"
description: "Canonical intake for https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/issues/1695. Implement the reported SDK and CLI recovery contract after current-source reproduction, preserving deterministic validation, privacy and no-write refusal behavior."
type: Issue
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[4]: agent-ux,config,"gh:1695",sdk
created_at: "2026-11-09T07:32:05.563Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-10T00:11:14.208Z"
closed_at: "2026-11-10T00:11:13.312Z"
completed_at: "2026-11-10T00:11:13.312Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: Accept every supported settings path as an alias in SDK-backed config get/set without bypassing validation; Unknown keys offer at most three nearest legal keys and a working config-list inspection command; Preserve complete legal keys in structured recovery and reject unknown keys without settings writes
parent: pm-8jdc
risk: medium
confidence: high
resolution: "Accept validated settings-path aliases and all scalar context leaves through shared SDK setters; preserve full context depth and consistent strict integer grammar and bounds in grouped/dotted writes and profiles. Return bounded suggestions and a complete scoped SDK key domain with an executable tracker-preserving inventory command. Preserve optional typed section toggles, grouped minimum explanations and uniform depth normalization. Consolidate the real integration imports without changing assertions."
expected_result: "Declared configuration aliases and paths use shared validation, invalid inputs preserve settings, scoped SDK recovery remains complete, and real CLI replay preserves the selected tracker."
actual_result: "All four linked command entries pass, including config and selected-tracker integration, profile lint/application, key discovery and public typetests. Final four integration cases and ESLint pass after import consolidation. The preceding production-identical head passed 495 instrumented tests, nine packed consumers, all 475 declaration equivalence checks and unchanged artifact budgets. Whole-source hosted exact coverage and current-head review remain required for PR1696."
